Package: zanicc
Title: Bayesian nonparametric models for zero-inflated count-compositional
    data
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("André F. B.", "Menezes", , "andrefelipemaringa@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3320-9834")),
    person("Keefe", "Murphy", role = "ctb",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5668-7046"))
  )
Maintainer: André F. B. Menezes <andrefelipemaringa@gmail.com>
Description: Provides a collection of nonparametric and parametric models
    for the analysis of zero-inflated count-compositional data, including
    the zero-and-N-inflated multinomial (ZANIM)-BART and ZANIM
    logistic-normal (ZANIM-LN)-BART models.
